sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task, decision swamp-vault-secrets (vault.get, no secret inputs), F9 sync phases; DECISIONS round 2 (rendered .env pushed to vault after commit, vault.get from 209, no private-material fetch, no per-Node worker).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: env:sync<br/>{instance: 42}
  Note over GW: Lock env, render .env<br/>push to vault after commit
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-instance-environment
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5131
  SW->>N: Read key names, check<br/>@swamp/ssh · values stay on Node
  N-->>SW: key names, write check
  SW->>N: Write .env, .env.testing<br/>vault.get · @swamp/ssh from 209
  opt production, file changed
    SW->>N: Refresh runtime<br/>config cache, OPcache, Processes
  end
  alt all steps succeed
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>key names, changed flag
    Note over GW: Record owned keys<br/>clear refresh pending
  else a key would drop
    N--xSW: env.sync_would_drop_keys
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code, key names
    Note over GW: Stored values stay<br/>task → failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5131
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
